# Baron Strucker, HYDRA Overlord: "Whenever another Villain you control enters, you may have it connive. Do this only once each
# turn." Robot Domination's third plan counter makes three Robot Villains at once, so three triggers wait together; the first
# is accepted and its Robot connives (draws, discards an Ornithopter, a nonland card: a +1/+1 counter), and the other two
# find the turn's one spent (CR 603.2h, 603.4) and ask nothing, so those Robots stay 2/2.

